  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_002
    speakerId: yowashi
    expressionId: normal
    text: "まだまだだな……ドウテ卿……鍛え直して……また来るといい……"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_003
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_003
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "ヨワシちゃんもバテバテじゃん……\n　やったの2分とかだよ？"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_004
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_004
    speakerId: yowashi
    expressionId: normal
    text: "我が体に……巣食うベルゼバブが……少し暴れ始めただけだ……まだまだいくぞ……ドウテ卿！！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_005
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_005
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "いいよ！どんと来い！！"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_006
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_006
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "その後のことはあまり覚えていない。"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_007
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_007
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "ヨワシちゃんが倒れ、救急隊員らしき人に運ばれていった。俺はそれを見ていることしかできず、立ち尽くしていた。"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_008
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_008
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "気がつくと俺は俺の家にいて、白いあの部屋なんて見当たらなくなっていた。しかし俺の手には、自販機で買ったあのボールだけが残されていた。"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: 
    nextLineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_009
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
  - lineId: chapter_yowashi_catchfailure_009
    speakerId: doute
    expressionId: normal
    text: "きっと夢だ。あんな部屋なんてあるわけないんだ。俺はそう思うことしかできなかった。"
    background: {fileID: 0}
    revealSpeakerName: 0
    consultationTitle:
    nextScenePath: Assets/Scenes/GameMap/Title.unity
    nextLineId: 
    choices: []
    affectionChanges: []
    archiveUnlockIds: []
    branches: []
